("v23616", "key", "source")
("v23617", "type", "String")
("v23617", "scalar", "Original derived actuarial mathematics inspired by Promislow (2015), chapters 2.12–2.13 and 20.13, published book reference https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/fundamentals-of-actuarial/9781118782521/; supporting published actuarial reference https://www.jstor.org/stable/2951677. The proposed model is rooted in Promislow chapter 2.12–2.13 and 20.13. The target Lean identity is an original derivation, not a verbatim published result. Published source page 367 gives the thematic chapter context, rather than an exact statement of this new formal theorem.")
