("v26959", "type", "String")
("v26959", "scalar", "Original derived actuarial mathematics inspired by Promislow (2015), chapters 20.1–20.11, published book reference https://www.oreilly.com/library/view/fundamentals-of-actuarial/9781118782521/; supporting published actuarial reference https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-405X(79)90015-1. The proposed model is rooted in Promislow chapter 20.1–20.11. The target Lean identity is an original derivation, not a verbatim published result. Published source page 339 gives the thematic chapter context, rather than an exact statement of this new formal theorem.")
