("v65191", "type", "String")
("v65191", "scalar", "Independently certified supporting polynomial-transform bound motivated by Pintz, arXiv:1804.09084v2, Section 6, Lemmas 3 and 5, especially Eq. (6.25)-(6.28), pp. 27-29, https://arxiv.org/pdf/1804.09084v2#page=28. Exact domain: a >= 0, 1/2 <= b <= 9/10, |t| >= 7/2. This statement has no upper bound on a, and is not a verbatim statement of Lemma 5. An 83-cell outward-rounded rational certificate closes the compact negative-strip sign; the analytic norm-eight tail and right-half-plane positivity complete the argument. No mathematical novelty claim or proof of strong Goldbach.")
("v65190", "value", "v65191")
